 shells to help you find the treasures you are searching for. Whether it’s your first time combing the beach or your an avid collector,  we know where to find the best shells this area is known for.\n\n\n## Departure Location\nWe depart from the **Goodland Boat Park located at 750 Palm Point Dr, Goodland, FL 34140.** This location includes a 5.22 acre park, restrooms, concessions for sale from sunscreen to food and allows easy access to the Ten Thousand Islands and Gulf of Mexico.", "description_text": "", "description_bullets": "", "seo_description": "", "location": "Goodland Boat Park", "booking_notes": "![Thank you for booking](https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/6HeSiQ6XQ2SGZN4lGJ7I)\n[![CLICK HERE FOR DIRECTIONS](https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/ggr7BmDWRneMAwYCoEPO)](https://www.google.com/maps/dir/25.955731,-81.7238755/GOODLAND+BOATING+PARK/@25.9391063,-81.7682825,12z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m9!4m8!1m1!4e1!1m5!1m1!1s0x88daf10a7e5f5a7b:0xd9efbd83fb662eaa!2m2!1d-81.6464898!2d25.9217576?entry=ttu)", "cancellation_notes": "Customers will receive a full refund if they cancel their reservation 48 hours prior to the date and time of their booking, (customers will be charged in full within the 48 hour period before the booking). Changes on your reservation will be received 48 hours in advance, otherwise your will be charged in full for your original booking. Contact us by phone to cancel or inquire about a cancellation. No-shows will be charged the full price. Customers will also receive a full refund in case of operator cancellation due to weather or other unforeseen circumstances.", "no_transportation_notes": "", "no_transportation_minutes": 15, "headline": "Starting at $140 • Boat tours up to 14 people or Private Groups up to 17 people.", "short_description": "", "image_url": "", "image_cdn_url": "", "images": [{"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/floridaadventuresandrentals/items/154092/images/904398/", "pk": 904398, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_ur